Shoulder Surfing Reloaded for Sunrise 26.3 (version 0.5.0)

A port of Shoulder Surfing Reloaded (5.3.1) by Exopandora and contributors.
Original source: https://github.com/Exopandora/ShoulderSurfing
Original licence: MIT

Ported to Sunrise by arismoko: the camera, picking, crosshair and input rules are
implemented in Rust on Sunrise's typed mod API (no Java code is included). This port is
distributed under the same licence as the original (MIT); the licence text is in LICENSE.

The original project's MIT-licensed resources are carried over as they are: the language
files (assets/shouldersurfing/lang), the three crosshair sprites
(assets/shouldersurfing/textures/gui/sprites/hud) and the mod icon (icon.png). The
`shouldersurfing.option.*` labels in the English language file were added for this port.
